<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="ZEC" style="id">Zekhariah</book>
  <para style="h">Zekhariah</para>
  <para style="toc1">Zekhariah</para>
  <para style="toc2">Zekhariah</para>
  <para style="mt">Zekhariah</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Darias in Persia siangpahrang a ṭuannak kum hnihnak kum, thlariat thla ah, Iddo ih fasuan, Berekhiah ih fapa profet Zekhariah hnenah Bawipa ih thu cu hiti in a ra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa in Zekhariah cu Israel mi hnenah hiti in sim dingin a fial. “Keimah, nan Bawipa cu nan pu le pa pawl parah ka thin a heng ngaingai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />asinain atu-ah nan hnenah hiti in ka lo sim. Ka hnenah ra kir uhla nan hnenah ka kir ve ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nan pu le nan pa bangtuk si hlah uh. Khuahlan laiah profet pawl in ka thu an sim hai ih sualnak tuah lo ding le thil ṭha lo tuah lo dingin an sim. Asinain ka thu an ngai duh lo, a thlun khal an thlun lo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cuih profet pawl le nan pupa pawl cu an nung nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka sal profet pawl hmangin nan pupa pawl ka thu le ka thukham ka pek, a sinan zianghman ah an siar lo; curuangah harsatnak tampi an tong a si. Cule hremtlak an si ruangih hrem dingih a rak tumtu cu Cungnungbik Bawipa keimah ka si kha an run thei ih an sir-aw sal a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Darias in siangpahrang a ṭuannak kum hnihnak kum, thla hleikhat thla (Shebat thla), ni kul hluanli ni ah zan ah Bawipa in langnak in thu i sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Rang sen par a tomi Bawipa ih vancungmi pakhat, phairawn ih lenhmui kung lakah a cawl ih a dungah rang dang pawl an um: rang sen, rang ṭial le rang raang pawl tla an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“ Bawipa , hi rang pawl ih tican cu ziangso a si?” tiah ka sut. Vancungmi in, “Atican ka lo sim ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Leilung pumpi thleng thluh ding le zoh dingah Bawipa in a thlah a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Rang pawl cun, vancung mi hnenah, “Leilung tlun khuazakip ah kan thleng ṭheh zo ih leilung pumpi cu daitein le hnangamte in a um a si, ti kan hmu zo,” tiah an sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cutikah vancungmi cun, “Cungnungbik Bawipa , Jerusalem le Judah khawpi dang pawl parah kum sawmsarih sung na thin a heng zo. An parih zaangfah thinpemnak na neih sal hlan, ziangtik tiangso hiti in an um hrih ding,” tiah an sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bawipa in vancungmi cu thinhnemnak ṭongkam in a sawn ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />cuih Cungnungbik Bawipa ih ṭongkam cu tlang-aupi ding ah vancungmi in i fial. “Ka khawpi thianghlim Jerusalem hrangah duhdawtnak le seherhnak tamzet ka nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Asinain thlangamnak le daihnak a ngahtu miphun pawl parah ka thin ka sup rero naón cuih miphun pawl in ka minung pawl tuarnak cu an luarter deuhdeuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Curuangah Jerusalem khawpi parih ka zaangfahnak langter dingah ka ra kir a si. Ka Biakinn cu saksaal a si ding ih Jerusalem khawpi cu dinsal a si ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Vancungmi in ka hnenah, “Cungnungbik Bawipa in ‘Ka khua pawl cu an ṭhangsozet sal ding ih Jerusalem khawpi cu ka bawm ding ih ka ta tiah ka ti sal ding,’ a ti. Cumi cu tlang-aupi hrih aw,” tiah i ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Langnak pakhat a um sal ih cawcang ki pali ka hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka hnenih a ṭong rerotu vancungmi hnenah cun, “Hi ki pawl ih tican cu ziangso a si?” tiah ka sut. Anih in, “Judah mi, Israel mi le Jerusalem mi pawl khuazakip ih a ṭhekdarhtu miphun pawl can-ai an si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cule Bawipa in sobul thawn hnaṭuantu pali i hmuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Himi pawl hi ziang tuah dingah so an rat?” tiah ka sut. Anih in, “Himi pawl cu Judah ram a ṭiotertu le a minung pawl a ṭhekdarh ṭhehtu miphun pawl ṭhihṭhaih ding le hlonhlo ṭheh dingah an ra a si,” tiah i sawn.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Langnak dang pakhat ah mi pakhat tahnak hri a kut ah kengin ka hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Khui-ah so na feh ding?” tiah ka sut. Anih in, “Jerusalem khawpi hi ziangcan a sau ih ziangtluk a kau ti theih duh ah ka tah ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cule ka hnenih a ṭong rerotu vancungmi cu hmaiah a ra suak ih a dang vancungmi pakhat in a rak hmuak khi ka hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A hmaisa vancungmi in a neta hnen ahcun, “Va tlan awla, tahnak hri a kengtu tlangvalpa khi Jerusalem khawpi sungah minung le caw an tam ngaingai leh ding ih an tumtuk ah phar in kulh cawk a si lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa in thu a kam zo ih Bawipa amah cu khawpi kimvel ah khawpi humtu meisa phar a si ding ih cu tawk ah a sunlawinak thawn a um ding a si, va ti aw,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawipa in a minung pawl hnenah, “Keimah in leilung khuazakip ah ka lo ṭhekdarh ṭheh. Asinain atu cu Babilon ram in ra suak uhla, Jerusalem ah ra kir sal uh, nannih saltaang pawl!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nanmah a lo hremtu in a lo dai tikah keimah ih mitmu a dai a si,” a ti. Curuangah Cungnungbik Bawipa in keimah cu a minung pawl a ramtu miphun pawl hnen ah hi thu sim dingin i thlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“ Bawipa keimah rori in ka lo do ding ih nan sal a rak si dah mi pawl in an lo ram ve thlang ding,” tiah Bawipa in a ti. Cumi a kim tikah Cungnungbik Bawipa ih thlahmi ka si kha zokhal in an thei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Maw Jerusalem mi pawl, lungawi in hlasa uh. Nan hnenih um dingah ka ra lai a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cutikah cun miphun tampi Bawipa ih hnenah an ra ding ih amah ih minung ah an cang ding. Nan lakah a um ding ih nan hnen ih i thlahmi ka si kha nan thei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cutikah hi a ram thianghlim sungah hin Judah cu a hleice in amah ih ta an si ding ih Jerusalem cu khua dang hmuahhmuah hnak in a duh bikmi khawpi a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bawipa ih umnak hmunah cun zokhal daitein um uh; ziangahtile a umnak hmun thianghlim ihsin a ra lai a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Langnak dang pakhat ah Bawipa in Puithiam sang Joshua, Bawipa ih vancungmi hmai ih a din kha i hmuh. Joshua kiangah cun Joshua sualpuh dingah tiar cia in Satan a din kha ka hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa ih vancungmi in Satan hnen ahcun, “Satan, Bawipa in lo kawk seh! Jerusalem a duhtu Bawipa in nangmah cu lo hlon seh. Hi pa cu meisa sung ihsin zuukmi thingthu bangtuk a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Joshua cu hnipuan siava hruk in cutawk ah a ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cuih vancungmi in amah kiltu vancungmi dang pawl hnen ah, “Hi pa ih a hrukmi hnipuan siava pawl cu phuak ṭheh uh,” a ti. Cule Joshua hnenah cun, “Na sualnak cu ka lak hlo ṭheh zo ih hruk ding hnipuan thar ka lo pek ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amah kiltu pawl cu Joshua lu parah lupawng thar pawngter dingin thu a pek. A thu pekmi vekin an tuah, cule cutawk ih vancungmi a din laiah cun hnipuan thar an hrukter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cule vancungmi in Joshua hnen ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa ih ṭongmi cu hiti in a sim; “Ka daan nan thlun ih nan hnenih ṭuanvo ka lo pekmi pawl nan tuah suak a si ahcun ka Biakinn le a kimvel pawl kilkhawitu nan si ringring ding ih ka mit hmuh ih a ummi vancungmi pawl ih thlacamnak ka theihsak vekin nan thlacamnak khal ka lo theihsak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Curuangah nang Puithiam sang Joshua, ṭhatein ngai aw; nannih Joshua rualpi puithiam pawl, hmailam tikcu ṭha khihhmuhtu nannih pawl, ṭhatein ngai uh: Thingṭeek an timi keimah riantu cu nan hnenah ka langter ding!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Joshua hmaiah hmai pasarih a neimi lungto pakhat ka ret ding. A parah ca ka ngan ding ih ni khat sungah hi ram ih sualnak cu ka lak hlo ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cuih ni a thlen tikah cun nan sabit hmuan le nan theipi hmuan sung ih umtlang huahho ding in nan inn-hnen pawl nan sawm fingfing ding a si,” tiah a ti. Guam.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka hnen ih a ṭong rerotu vancungmi cu a ra sal ih a itthat mi ṭhang vekin i ra ṭhang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Ziang so na hmuh?” tiah i sut. Kei in, “Sui in tuahmi mei-inn tohnak ka hmu. A tlun ah meiti retnak kheng a um. Mei-inn tohnak par ahcun mei-inn pasarih an um ih mei-inn pakhat in meica thulnak ong pasarih an nei fingfing.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mei-inn tohnak kiangah olif thingkung pahnih, a sir veve ah an um ka hmu,” tiah ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cule vancungmi cu, “Hi thil pawl ih sullam ziangso an si, bawipa?” tiah ka sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amah in, “Sullam na thei lo maw?” i ti. Kei in, “Bawipa, ka thei lo,” tiah ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vancungmi cun Cungnungbik Bawipa ih hnen ihsin a rami thu cu Zerubbabel sim dingin i fial. Bawipa in, “Hriamnam cahnak le na thazaang cahnak in si loin ka thlarau in na hlawhtling ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na hmaiah khamtu tlang tia a um hmanah an hlo ṭheh ding. Biakinn cu na din sal ding ih biakinn saknak a neta bik lungto na dawl tikah misenpi pawl cu, ‘A mawizet, a mawizet,’ tiah an au ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipa ih thu cu ka hnenah a ra thleng sal ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Biakinn hram cu Zerubbabel in a dawl thok zo ih a saksuak ding. Cumi a kim ngaingai tikah ka minung pawl in an hnenah nangmah a lo thlahtu keimah ka si kha an thei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An biakinn sak hnaṭuannak a sawt lo ti an theih tikah an thin a nauzet. Sikhalsehla Zerubbabel in Biakinn cu taimak zetin a sak rero ko ti kha an hmuh tikah an lung a awi ding,” tiah a ti. Vancungmi cun, “Mei-inn pasarih cu leilungtlun khuazakip a hmu ṭhehtu Bawipa ih mit pasarih tican a si,” tiah i ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cule kei in, “Mei-inn tohnak sir ih a ummi olif thingkung pahnih ih tican ziangso a si?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Olif hriak a rung luannak sui in tuahmi dawng pahnih kiangih olif thinghnge pahnih ih tican ziangso a si?” tiah ka sut lala.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Anih cun, “Atican na thei lo maw?” i ti. Kei in, “Bawipa, ka thei lo a si,” tiah ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cutikah anih in, “Himi pawl cu leilung pumpuluk ih Bawi a si mi Pathian in a hrilmi le hriak a culhmi minung pahnih an si,” tiah i ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka hun zoh sal ih thli lakah cazual a zam kha ka hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Vancungmi in, “Ziang so na hmuh?” tiah i sut. Kei in, “Thli lakah cazual a zammi ka hmu. Cuih cazual cu dong kul a sau ih dong hra a kau,” tiah ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cutikah ka hnenah, “Hi cazual parah hin hi ram ih a thleng dingmi siatserhnak an ngan a si. Hmaikhat ah hi ram ihsin rukru hmuahhmuah hlonhlo an si ding tiah an ngan; khatlam ahcun siatcam in thuphan a permi hmuahhmuah tla hlonhlo an si ding tiah an ngan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa in, cuih siatserhnak cu keimah in ka suahter ding ih rukru innsung le siatcam in thuphan a pertu innsung kipah a thleng ding, tiah a ti. Cuih siatserhnak cu an innsungah a caam ding ih cuih inn ih thing siseh lungto siseh a siatsuah ṭheh ding,” tiah i ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Vancungmi cu a ra lang sal ih, “Zohhnik, thildang pakhat a ra thleng ding!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Ziang so a si?” tiah ka sut. Anih in, “Bawm pakhat a si ih cuih bawm cu leilung pumpuluk ih sualnak can ai a si,” tiah i ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cuih bawm cu sin a nei ih suan in tuahmi a si. Ka hmuhhngan ah a sin cu an ong ih a sungah cun nunau pakhat a rak to.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vancungmi in, “Hi nunau cu ṭhatlonak ai-awhtu a si,” tiah a ti. Cule cu nu cu bawm sungah cun an nam cih ih a siin a vun sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka hun zoh ih nunau pahnih vaca thla vek ih a cakzet thla pawl thawn ka lam ih an ra zam kha ka hmu. Bawm cu an cawi ih an zampi hlo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cutikah vancungmi cu, “Khuiah so an fehpi ding?” tiah ka sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Anih in, “Babilon ah an fehpi ding ih cutawkah a hrangah biakinn an sak sak ding. Cuih biakinn an sak ṭheh tikah bawm cu biak dingah cutawkah an ret ding,” tiah i sim. Guam.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Langnak a dang pakhat ka hmu ih tlang pahnih karlak ihsin rangleng pali an ra suah kha ka hmu. Cuih tlang pahnih cu dar tlang an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pakhatnak rangleng cu rang sen in an hnuk, pahnihnak cu rang dum in an hnuk,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />pathumnak cu rang raang in an hnuk ih palinak cu rang ṭial in an hnuk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cule vancungmi cu, “Bawipa, hi rangleng pawl ih tican ziangso a si?” tiah ka sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Anih in, “Hi pawl cu thli pali an si. Leilung pumpuluk ih Bawipa hnen ihsin atu pekte a rami an si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Rang dum pawl ih hnuhmi rangleng cu saklam ah a feh, rang raang pawl ih hnuhmi cu nitlaknak lam ah a feh, rang ṭial pawl ih hnuhmi cu thlanglam ram ah a feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Rang pawl an ra suah tikah leilung pumpi va zoh ding kha an hngakhlap zet. Vancungmi cun, “Feh uhla, leilung cu va zoh uh!” a ti; a ti vek cun an va zoh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cutikah vancung mi cun “Saklam ram lam ih a fehtu rang pawl in Bawipa ih thinhengnak an daiter zo a si,” tiah in run auh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bawipa ih ṭongkam cu ka hnenah hiti in a ra thleng ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawipa cun, “Saltaannak ihsin a ra kirmi Heldai, Tobijah le Jedaiah pawl ih laksawng cu la awla Zefaniah ih fapa Josiah inn ah zamrang in feh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Anmah pawl ih laksawng pekmi sui le ngun in sui lukhuh tuah awla Jehozadak ih fapa Puithiam Sang Joshua khumter aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A hnenah, Cungnungbik Bawipa in, ‘Thingṭeek ti ih kawhmi cu atu a umnak ah a ṭhangso ding ih Bawipa ih Biakinn amah in a sak sal ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Biakinn a sak saaltu cu amah a si ding ih siangpahrang tlukin hminthannak a ngah ding ih a minung pawl amah in a uk ding. Puithiam pakhat a bawi tokham kiangah a ding ding ih, daihnak le remnak thawn hmunkhat ah hna an ṭuan tlang ding, a ti,’ tiah ti aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cuih suilukhuh cu Bawipa ih Biakinn sungah a um ding ih Heldai, Tobijah, Jedaiah le Josiah pawl theih ringringnak a si ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lamhlapi ih a ummi pawl khal an ra ding ih Bawipa ih Biakinn cu an ra sak bawm ding. Cutiih an sak tikah Cungnungbik Bawipa , in nan hnenah keimah i thlah hi nan thei ding. Bawipa , nan Pathian thupekmi nan thlunkim a si ahcun a tlunlam thil hmuahhmuah hi a kim ṭheh ding a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Darias in siangpahrang a ṭuannak kum linak kum, thlakua thla (Kislev thla), ni li ni ah Bawipa ih thu cu ka hnenah a ra thleng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bethel khua mi pawl in Sharezer le Regemmelek cu an milai pawl thawn Cungnungbik Bawipa ih Biakinn ah Bawipa ih thlawsuahnak dil dingah le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />puithiam pawl le profet pawl thusuh dingah an thlah. An thusuh mi cu, “Biakinnpi siatsuah ṭheh a si ruangah kum tampi sung kan rak tuah zo vekin thla nga thla ah rawl ul in riahsia le lungngai in kan um hrih pei maw?” ti a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa thu cu ka hnenah a ra thleng ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Hi ram minung le puithiam pawl hi sim aw: kumpi kum sawm sarih sung, thla nga thla le thla sarih thla ah rawl an ul ih riahsia le lungngai in an um hi keimah in upat ruangah a si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ti le rawl an in an ei tik khal ah anmah ih diriamnak lawnglawng ah a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jerusalem cu ṭhangso le neinungzet in a rak um ih minung tampi an rak um lai caanah le hi khawpi kiangkap khua tla ah mi tampi an rak um lawng si loin thlanglam ramah le nitlaknak lam tlanghram tla ih mi tampi an rak um lai caanah hi bangtuk in Bawipa in khuahlan profet pawl hmangin a rak sim zomi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipa in hi thu cu Zekhariah hnenah a sim:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Khuahlan ah hi thukham pawl cu ka minung hnenah ka rak pek: Dingte in thu nan rel pei ih pakhat le pakhat parah zaangfahnak le lainatnak nan nei pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nuhmei pawl le farah pawl, nan lakih a ummi ramdangmi pawl le a hlawhsammi pawl nan namsuk lo pei. Cule pakhat le pakhat siatsuah awk nan tum lo pei, ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sikhalsehla ka minung pawl cu mi thinlungruh pawl an si; ka thupekmi thlun duh loin an dunglam in hoisan; an hna an phit ih zianghman an ngai duh lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />an thinlung cu lungto vekin a hak a si. Kum reipi laiih ka thlarau thawn ka rak thlahmi profet pawl sungin thu ka zirhmi pawl an ngai duh lo ruangah an parah ka thin a heng ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thu ka sim tikih an ngai duh lo ruangah annih khal thla an cam tikah ka ngai duh ve lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thlisia bangin ka semhlo hai ih an theih dah lonak ram dangdang ah ka ṭhekdarh ṭheh. Hi tluk ram ṭha cu a sungah zohman um loin ramṭhing ah a cang a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa ih thu cu Zekhariah hnenah hiti in a ra thleng:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Jerusalem mi pawl ka duhdawtnak cu a thuk ih Jerusalem khawpi bawm ding cu ka caakzet; ka thiik ruangah a ral pawl parah ka thin a heng a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka ra kir sal ding ih ka khawpi thianghlim Jerusalem ah ka ra um ding. Rintlak khawpi tiin theih a si ding ih Cungnungbik Bawipa ih tlang cu tlang thianghlim tiin kawh a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kianghrol hrol in a fehtu nutar le patar pawl khal khawpi sung mi zapi ton awknak hmunah an to huahho sal ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khawpi lamzin tluanah nauhak tualleng pawl cu nunau siseh mipa siseh lungawi aipuang in an lek ciamco sal ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Cutiih ka timi cu hi miphun sung ihsin a taangmi pawl hrangah cun thil cang thei lo a bang ding, sihmansehla ka hrangah cun thil cang thei lo a si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka minung pawl an hruaihlonak ram pawl ah ka hum ding ih
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />nisuahnak lam le nitlaknak lam ihsin ka hruai kir sal ding ih Jerusalem ah an um sal ding. Annih cu ka minung an si ding ih keimah cu an Pathian ka si ding; rintlakzet le dingzet in ka uk ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ralṭhatnak nei uh! Biakinn dinsal dingah a hram an rak thok lai ih profet pawl in an rak simmi ṭongkam cu atu-ah nan thei sal a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cuih hlanah cun zohman in minung siseh, ṭilva siseh hnaṭuan dingah an lak thei lo, an sang thei lo; ral an nei ih humhimnak an um hrimhrim lo. Mi pakhat le pakhat ral aw dingin keimah in ka tokhrok.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sikhalsehla atu-ah cun hi ramsung ih a taangsun mi pawl ka zohnak cu a phundang a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hnangam in an thlaici an tuh thei thlang ding. An sabit hri in rah an rah ding, leilung in rawl a suah ding ih ruah tampi in a sur ding a si. Ka miphun sung ihsin a taangsun mi pawl parah hi bangtuk thlawsuahnak ka pek ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Judah mi le Israel mi pawl! Tuih hlanah cun ramdangmi pawl pakhat le pakhat an cam awk tikah ‘Judah le Israel pawl parih a thlengmi siatralnak hi na parah thleng ve seh,’ an ti aw. Sikhalsehla keimah in ka lo runsuak ding ih cu tikah ramdangmi pawl cun ‘Judah le Israel mi pawl ih comi thlawsuahnak co ve hram aw,’ tiah pakhat le pakhat an ti aw ding. Curuangah nan ral ṭha uhla zianghman ṭih hlah uh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa in, “Nan pu le nan pa pawl in ka thin in hengter tikah anmah siatralnak cu ka tum ih zianghman thinlung thlengnak um loin ka tum vek cun ka tuah suak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sikhalsehla atu-ah cun Jerusalem le Judah mi pawl thlawsuah dingah ka tum a si. Curuangah phannak zianghman nei hlah uh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hitiin tuah sawn uh: Pakhat le pakhat nan biak awk tikah thudik sim uh. Thuṭhennak hmunah thudik suakter uh; daihnak le remnak suaktertu thudik cu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Midang siatnak ding thu ngaihtuah hlah uh. A dik lomi tetti in siatcam hlah uh. Thuphan pernak, dinglonak le thazaang thawn midang siatnak tuah cu ka hua a si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa ih thu cu Zekhariah hnenah hiti in a ra thleng:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Thla linak, thla nganak, thla sarihnak le thla hranak ih tuah ṭheumi rawl ulhnak cu Judah mi pawl hrangah lungawi aipuannak puai ah a cang thlang ding. Thudik le daihnak cu nan duh pei,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa in, “Khua tampi ihsin mi tampi Jerusalem ih an ratnak tikcu a ra thleng zik thlang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Khawpi pakhat ihsin a rami pawl in khawpi dang ihsin a rami pawl hnenah, ‘Cungnungbik Bawipa kan biak ding ih a thlawsuahnak kan dil ding. Kan hnenah ra tel ve uh,’ an ti ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Minung tamzet le miphun cakzetzet pawl Jerusalem ah an ra ding ih Cungnungbik Bawipa an ra biak ding, a thlawsuahnak dil in thla an cam ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cutikah Judah mi pakhat hnenah ramdangmi pahra an ra ding ih, ‘Na nun khawsaknak ah um ve le tel ve kan duh, ziangahtile Pathian cu na hnenah a um, ti kan thei zo,’ an ti ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Himi cu Bawipa ih ṭongkam a si: Hadrak ram le Damaskas khawpi hrem dingah amah in a ruat cat zo. Israel miphun pawl lawng si loin Siria ram khawpi khal Bawipa ih ta a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hadrak ramri ih a ummi Hamath khua tla amah ih ta a si ih cuvek ṭhiamṭhiam in ṭai-ar khua le Sidon khua pawl tla an thilthiamnak thawn Bawipa ih ta an si ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ṭai-ar khua cun amah ih hrangah ralhruang nasa zetin a tuah ciamco ih tlunah sui le ngun tamzet a khawl ih a tamtuk ah hnawmhne bangtuk ah a cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Asinain Bawipa cun ṭai-ar khua ih a neihmi hmuahhmuah cu a laksak ṭheh ding. A lennak hmuahhmuah cu tifinriat sungah a hlonsak ding ih a cuih khua cu meisa in ur ziam a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cumi cu Ashkelon khua in a hmu ding ih a phang ding. Gaza khal in a hmu ding ih a tuarzet ding. Cuvek thotho in Ekron khua khal in a hmu ding ih ruahsannak a neihmi hmuahhmuah a hloral ṭheh ding. Gaza siangpahrang khal a hloral ding ih Ashkelon cu a ṭhing reprep ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ashdod khua ah miphun za-rawi an um ding. Bawipa in “Hi a puarthau zetmi Filistin mi pawl cu nau ko in ka ṭhum ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thisen thawn sa cu an ei nawn lo ding; khammi rawl khal an ei nawn lo ding. A taangsun pawl cu ka miphun ah an tel ve ding ih Judah phun sungah phunkhat vek an si ding. Jebus mi pawl bangtuk in Ekron khal ka miphun ah a cang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka ram cu ka kilveng dingih a sungin zo ralkap pawl hman an feh thei lo ding. Zaangfah neilo ram uktu zohman in ka miphun an hrem nawn lo ding. Ka minung pawl ih tuarzia ka hmu ṭheh zo,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nan lungawi uh, Zion mi pawl, nan lungawi uh! Lungawi in au ciamco uh, Jerusalem mi pawl! Zoh uh, nan siangpahrang a ra lai! Nehtu a si ih nehnak thawn a ra; Asinain lungnemmi a si ih laak parin a ra; Laak note, laakpi ih faate to in a ra a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Israel ram ihsin raldonak rangleng ka hlon ding; Jerusalem ihsin raldonak rang pawl ka lak sak ding ih, Raldonak likhuk pawl cu ka siatsuah ṭheh ding. Nan siangpahrang in mi phunkip pawl thawn daihnak le remnak a tuah ding. Khatlam tifinriat in khatlam tifinriat tiang a uk ding. Eufrates tivapi ihsin vanrang deng tiang a uk ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Raithawinak thisen thawn hngettermi nan hnen ih ka thukamnak vekin, Nan minung pawl cu ka luatter ding; Saltaannak tidai um lo khur sung ihsin ka luatter ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kir sal uh, ruahsannak neitu saltaang pawl! Himnak hmun nan ram ah tlung uh; Atu-ah ka lo sim: harnak nan tuarmi ruangah a let hnih in thlawsuahnak ka lo pe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Judah cu ralkap ih li vekin ka hmang ding, Israel cu conkiang vekin ka hmang ding, Zion mi pawl cu ralnam vekin ka hmang ding, Grik mi pawl do dingah,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bawipa cu a minung pawl tlunah a lang ding, A thal pawl nimthlakau vekin a sai ding. Cungnungbik Bawipa in a tawtawrawt a tum ding; Thlanglam thlipi sungin a feh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa in a minung pawl a hum ding. An ral pawl an siatsuah ṭheh ding, Lungherh deengtu pawl an palcih ding; Raldonak ah zuri bangin an au ciamco ding ih, An ral pawl ih thisen an suahter ding. Cuih thisen cu biakṭheng ih a ummi kheng sung ihsin an thletmi thawinak thisen vekin a luang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cuih ni a kim tikah tuukhal in a tuurual ṭihphannak sungin a hum vekin, Bawipa in a minung pawl a hum ding; Suilukhuh parih lungvar vekin, A ram sungah cun an tleu ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ziangtluk ram ṭha le ram mawi so a si ding! Vainim in tlangval a cakter dingih, Sabit in fala tla a cakter hai ding.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa ih hnenah thlatir ah ṭoruah dil uh. Khawdur a tuahtu le ruah a surtertu cu amah a si. Mi hmuahhmuah ih loram a hringtertu khal Bawipa a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Minung in milem le pol hnenah thu an ron, a sinan an simmi cu thulolak le thuphan lawng a si. Mi hrekkhat in mang an let, asinain a peengah an lo hruai; thinhnemnak ṭong an ṭongmi cu ṭhathnemnak zianghman a nei lo. Curuangah mipi pawl cu a hlomi tuu vekin an vakvai. Hotu an neih lo ruangah harsatnak an tong a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawipa in hiti in a ti. “Ka minung pawl a uktu parah ka thin a heng. Curuangah ka hrem hai ding. Judah mi pawl cu keimah ih ta an si ih Cungnungbik Bawipa keimah in ka kilkhawi ding. Anmah cu ka uarzetmi le a cakzetmi ka raldonak rang an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Anmah sung ihsin mi uktu pawl, mi hruaitu pawl le ralbawi pawl an suak ding ih ka minung pawl an uk ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lamzin ciarbek lakih an ral a palcil rerotu ralkap pawl vekin Judah mi pawl cu nehtu an si ding. Bawipa an hnenih a um ruangah ral an do ding ih an ral sungih rangralkap pawl hman an neh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Judah mi pawl cu mi cakzet ah ka tuah ding; Israel mi pawl ka runsuak ding. An parah lainatnak ka nei ding, An zate in an khua le an ram ah ka hruai kir ding. Ka hnon dah lomi vekah ruah an si ding. Keimah hi Bawipa an Pathian ka si, An thlacamnak ka theihsak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel mi pawl cu raldo thiam vekin an cak ding ih, Sabitti in bangtuk in an lung a nuam ding. An tesinfa pawl in hi nehnak cu an cing ding ih, Bawipa ih thiltuahmi ruangah an lung a awi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Ka minung pawl ka ko ding ih Hmunkhat ah ka finkhawm ding. Ka run hai dingih a hlan vekin mi tamzet ah an cang sal ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Miphun dang lakah ka ṭhekdarh zo hai naón, Ram hlazet khal in keimah in thei ding. Anmah le an faate pawl an nung suak ding ih, An khua le an ram ah an kir tlang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Izip ram le Assiria ram ihsin ka hruai kir ding ih, Anmah ih ram sungah hmun ka khuar sak ding. Gilead le Lebanon ram khal ah ka umter ding; Ram pumpuluk ah minung an khat ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Harsatnak tifinriat an tan tikah, Bawipa keimah in tilet cu ka vuak ding ih, Nail tiva thuk cu a kang ṭheh ding, A puarthaumi Assiria ningzak in a um ding ih, A maksakmi Izip huham a nei nawn lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka minung pawl Bawipa ah ka cakter ding; Ka hmin in lamzin an feh ding,” a ti. Bawipa in a sim zo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Maw Lebanon, na sangka pawl ong aw, Na sidar thingkung pawl meisa in kaang ṭhehseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tu farthing pawl, ṭap ai rero uh, Sidar kung pawl an tlu ṭheh zo; Thing sunglawi pawl siatsuah an si ṭheh zo. Bashan ram ih ṭhil thing pawl ṭap in ai rero ko uh. A ruul zetmi tupi cu hau ṭheh a si zo!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Uktu pawl riahsia in an ṭap an rak; An sunlawinak a cem zo. Kiosa pawl an huuk rero, ngaihnik uh! Jordan tivakap ih an inn a si mi tupi cu siatsuah ṭheh a si zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa ka Pathian in ka hnenah, “Thah ding a si mi tuu pawl a khaaltu ih nuncan kha cawng hnik.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A neitu pawl in tuu an that, asinain annih cu zohman in an mawhthluk hai lo. Tuusa zuar tahrat in, ‘ Bawipa cu thangṭhat si ko seh! Kan lian zo a si,’ an ti. Tuukhal pawl hman in an tuu pawl parah zaangfahnak an nei lo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Leilung tlun ah zohman ka zaangfah nawn lo ding. Keimah rori in mi hmuahhmuah cu an uktu pawl ih kutsung ah ka thunlut thluh ding. Cuih uktu pawl in leilung cu an tisiat ṭheh ding, asinain an thilti theinak huham sungin zohman ka run lo ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuu a leitu pawl le a zuartu pawl in an hnaṭuantu dingah kei cu in lak ih thah ding a si mi tuu pawl khaaltu ah ka cang. Funghreu pahnih ka lak: pakhat cu, “Zaangfahnak,” ka ti ih a dang pakhat cu “Komawknak,” ka ti. Cuti cun tuurual cu ka kilkhawi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Keimah i huatu tuukhal pathum parah cun ka thin a sau thei nawn lo, ka zawi thei nawn lo ih thla khat sungah an pathum in ka dawi hlo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cule tuurual hnenah cun, “A lo khaaltu ka si nawn lo ding. A thi ding cu thi ko hai seh, siatsuah ding cu siatsuah si ko seh. A taangmi cu pakhat le pakhat an sa ei-aw thluh ko hai seh,” ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cun, “Zaangfahnak,” timi funghreu cu ka lak ih, Bawipa in miphun hmuahhmuah thawn a tuahmi thukamnak bal ṭheh dingah ka khiak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cutiin cuih ni ah thukamnak rak tuahcia mi cu bal ṭheh a si. Tuu a leitu le a zuartu pawl cun in zohhliah ringring; ka thil tuah mi hi Bawipa ih simmi a si, ti kha an thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An hnenah “Nan lung a kim ahcun ka nihlawh i pe uh. A kim lo ahcun a poi lo, nanmah in nei ko uh,” tiah ka ti. Curuangah ka nihlawh ah ngun tangka sawmthum in pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bawipa in ka hnenah, “Hi tangka cu Biakinn tangka ah re aw,” i ti. Curuangah ngun tangka sawmthum, ka man ih an ruahmi tangka sunglawizet cu, ka lak ih Biakinn tangka retnak ah ka ret.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cuih hnuah a pahnihnak funghreu “Komawknak,” timi cu ka khiak lala; cutiin Judah le Israel kom awknak cu ka phiat a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cule Bawipa in ka hnenah, “Tuih ṭum cu zianghman ih santlai lo tuukhal pa ih nuncan cawng aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka tuurual kiltu dingah tuukhal pakhat ka ret; a sinan hlohralnak tongzikmi tuu pawl a hum duh lo; a hlomi tuu khal a hawl lo; hma a neimi tuu khal a tuamhlawm lo ih a harhdammi a taangsun tuu pawl tla rawl a pek lo. A thau bikmi tuusa a ei ih an ketin pawl tiangin a hawk ṭheh sawn a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cuih tuukhal pa cu a lamzin a pit ih a cem a si! A tuu pawl a tlansan zo. A cahnak hmuahhmuah ral in an siatsuah ṭheh ding. A baan a ro a car ding ih a vorhlam mit a caw ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel thuhla cu Bawipa ih hnen ihsin hiti in a ra thleng. Van tla khi a pharhtu Bawipa , leilung a seemsuah ih minung nunnak thlarau a petu Bawipa cun hiti in a sim:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Jerusalem cu khuat pakhat sungih sabitti vekah ka tuah ding; a kiangkap in miphun pawl cun an in ding ih zuri bangin an sawn ding. Cule Jerusalem an kulh tikah Judah ram khua dangdang tla an kulh thluh ve ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sikhalsehla cuih tikcu a thlen tikah Jerusalem cu a rit zetmi lungto ah ka tuah ding ih cawi a tumtu miphun cu tuahmawhnak a tong ding. Leilung tlun miphun hmuahhmuah cu Jerusalem do dingah an ṭangkhawm ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cuih tikcu ah an rang pawl cu an thin ka phangter ding ih rang parih a totu hmuahhmuah an thinlung ka aa-ter ṭheh ding. Judah mi pawl cu ka kilkhawi ding, a sinan an ral pawl ih rang mit cu ka cawtter ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cutikah Judah hrin pawl cun, “ Bawipa Cungnungbik Pathian in Jerusalem ih a ummi a minung pawl hnenah thazaang a pek a si,” tiah pakhat le pakhat an sim aw ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Cutikah Judah hrin pawl cu hramlak meisa tom bangtuk, a si lole vainim lo ih vainimkau kaang parih beel bangtuk ah ka tuah ding an kiangkap ih miphun hmuahhmuah an siatsuah thluh ding. Jerusalem khua mi pawl cu khawpi sungah an him ko ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“David tesinfa pawl le Jerusalem mi pawl ih ngah dingmi hminthannak kha Judah mi pawl ih ngah dingmi hnakin a thupit sawn lonak dingah hmaisabik ah Judah ralkap pawl hnenah Bawipa keimah in nehnak ka pek ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cutikah Jerusalem ih a ummi pawl cu Bawipa in a hum ding ih anmah lakih mi ṭawnṭai bik hman David tlukin a cak ding. David tesinfa pawl cun Bawipa ih vancungmi vekin lam an hruai ding; amah Pathian vek rero an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cutikah cun Jerusalem a dotu miphun hmuahhmuah cu ka siatsuah ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“David tesinfa pawl le Jerusalem khua ih midang pawl cu zaangfah lainatnak thinlung le thlacam duhnak thinlung thawn ka khahter ding. Mi pakhat an sun ciami kha an zoh ding ih an fa neihsun a thih ih an ṭah vekin an ṭah ding. An fapatir a thih ih ninghang le lungngai ih an um vekin an um ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cutikah cun Jerusalem khawsungih ṭahnak cu Megiddo phairawn ah Hadad-rimmon hrangih ṭahnak vekin a nasa ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hi ram innsang tinah mahte ciar lungngai in an um ding. David tefa sin innsang pawl, Nathan tesinfa innsang pawl, Levi tesinfa innsang pawl, Shimei tesinfa innsang pawl le innsang dang pawl tla cuticun an um ding. An innsang ciarah lungngai in an um ding ih mipa le nunau cu hmun dangdang ah lungngai in an um ding,” a ti. Guam.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa in, “Cu tikcu a thlen tikah David tesinfa pawl le Jerusalem mi pawl an sualnak le an milem biaknak ihsin thianfaiter dingah cerhti pakhat a put ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cutikah cun hi ram milem pawl ih hmin cu ka phiathlo ṭheh ding ih zohman in an cing nawn lo ding. Profet ka si a titu hmuahhmuah cu ka hlonhlo ṭheh ding ih milem biak duhnak thinlung khal ka lak hlo ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cule mi pakhatkhat in profet ṭong ih ṭong a tum thotho a si ahcun, a nu le a pa in, ‘ Bawipa ih hmin in thuphan na per ruangah na thi ding,’ tiah an ti ding. Cutin profet ṭong ih a ṭong tikah cun amah ih nu le pa in an sunthat ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cubangtuk tikcu a thlen tikah cun zovek profet hman langnak pakhatkhat a hmuh ruangah a uar aw lo ding, profet nun tla a cawng lo ding ih misenpi bumnak dingah profet pawl ih hruk ṭheumi, a hraam zetmi korfualpi tla a hruk lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cuhnak in anih cun ‘Kei cu profet ka si lo. Lothlo ka si; ka nunsung hmuahhmuah lothlo ka si ringring ko,’ a ti sawn ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cule mi pakhatkhat in ‘Na ṭaang ih tuahmawhnak hma pawl kha ziangruangah so a si?’ tiih a sut tikah ‘Ka rualpi inn ih ka ton pang mi an si,’ tiah a ti ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cungnungbik Bawipa in, “Maw, ralnam, tho awla ka hrangih hnaṭuantu tuukhal khi sat aw! That awla tuu pawl cu khuazakip ah ṭeekdarh ṭheh hai seh. Mi tenau pawl cu keimah in ka siatsuah ko hai ding;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />cule hi ram sung milai pawl ṭhen thum ih ṭhen hnih cu an thi ding. Ṭhen thum ih ṭhen khat lawng an luat ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cule a taangmi ṭhen thum ih ṭhen khat cu ka hniksak ding ih ngun cu meisa in a thianfaiter bangin ka thianfaiter ding. Sui cu hniksak a si vekin ka hniksak ding. Cule ka hnenah thla an cam ding ih ka theihsak ding. Ka minung an si kha ka sim ding ih keimah khal an Pathian ka si hi an phuang ding,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa in thu a ṭhennak ding ni cu a nai zo. Cule Jerusalem khua an ram ding ih an lonmi thilri pawl cu na mithmuh ah an zem ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa in miphun hmuahhmuah Jerusalem do dingah a ko khawm ding. Khawpi cu an lak ding, inn thilri pawl an long ding ih nunau pawl an kaihrem ding. Minung a hrek cu sal ah an kai ding, a sinan a dang pawl cu khawpi ihsin khui hmanah an hruaihlo lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cule Bawipa cu a vung feh ding ih cuih miphun pawl cu, khuahlan laiih a rak do vekin, a do ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cutikah Jerusalem ihsin nisuahnak lam Olif Tlang parah Bawipa cu a ding ding. Cule Olif Tlang cu nisuahnak lam ihsin nitlaknak lam ih a fehmi phairawn kaupi in ṭhen hnih ah a ṭhen ding. Tlang ih hrek cu saklam ah a ṭhawn ding ih a dang hrek cu thlanglam ah a ṭhawn ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Olif Tlang ṭhen hnih ih a ṭhentu cuih phairawn ihsin nan tlansuak ding. Judah siangpahrang Uzziah san laiah ling a rak hnin ih nan pu le nan pa pawl an rak tlansuak vekin nan tlan ve ding. Bawipa ka Pathian cu a ra ding ih a mithiang hmuahhmuah a rak hruai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cuih caan a thlen tikah khawsik le vurtlak ti a um lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khawthim tikhal a um nawn lo ding. Zan hmanah sun khawvang lawng a um ding. Ziangtikah cuvek in a si ding, ti cu Bawipa lawng in a thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cuih ni a thlen tikah cun Jerusalem ihsin nunnak tidai a luang ding; tidai hrek cu Tipi Thi ah a luang dingih a hrek cu Mediterranean tifinriat ah a luang ding. Ṭhal tilo, fur tilo kum letsuak in a luang ringring ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cule Bawipa cu leilung pumpuluk ih siangpahrang a si ding. Mi hmuahhmuah in Pathian tiah an biak ding ih amah ih hmin keel in an thei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hi leiram cu a zatein saklam ah Geba ihsin thlanglam ah Rimmon tiang hmun rawn ah tuah ṭheh a si ding. Jerusalem cu a kiangkap ram hnakin a sang cuang ding. Hi khawpi cu Benjamin kotka ihsin hlanlai ih kotka an rak umnak Akil Kotka timi tiang a kau ding; cule Hananel innsang ihsin siangpahrang sabit rialnak hmun tiang a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cutawkah mipi pawl cu humhimnak le thlangamnak thawn an um ding ih siatsuahnak zianghman an phang lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bawipa in Jerusalem a dotu miphun pawl parah tuksumza natnak a thlengter ding. An nung cungin an taksa a ṭawt ding; an mit le an lei pawl tla an ṭawt ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipa in an thin phangter in an lung a buaiter ding ih mi hmuahhmuah in an kiangih a ummi milai pohpoh kai tahrat in pakhat le pakhat an thawi aw ciamco ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Judah mi pawl in Jerusalem an ṭan ding ih ral an do ding. Miphun tampi ih thilri le lennak cu an long ding: sui, ngun le hnipuan ticawk loin an lak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />An ral pawl riahhmun ih a ummi ṭilva hmuahhmuah: rang pawl, laak pawl, kalauk pawl le laak faate pawl par khalah tuksumza natnak a thleng ve ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cule Jerusalem a dotu miphun pawl sungin a taangsun pawl cu Ziangkimtithei Bawipa cu siangpahrang a si tiih biak dingah le Puanthlam Puai tuah dingah kumtinte Jerusalem khua ah an feh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ziangkimtithei Bawipa cu siangpahrang a si tiah biak ding a eltu le a feh duh lotu leilung tlunih miphun pakhatkhat an um ahcun an ramah ruah a sur lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Izip mi pawl in Puanthlam Puai an tuah duh lo ih an feh duh lo a si ahcun Jerusalem feh a eltu le Pathian a bia duh lotu pawl parih tuksumza natnak Bawipa ih a thlentermi cu an parah a thleng ve ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Izip mi siseh, miphun dang siseh, Puanthlam Puai an tuah duh lo a si ahcun cubangtuk hremnak cu an parah a thleng ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cutikah cun rangleng hnuktu rang pawl parih thlaih mi darkhingte par hmanah “ Bawipa ih ta, a thianghlimmi a si,” tiah ngan ṭheh a si ding. Biakinn sungih rawl suannak beel pawl cu biakṭheng hmai ih kheng pawl vekin bungbeel thiang an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jerusalem le Judah ram pumpi sungih a ummi beel pohpoh cu Ziangkimtithei Bawipa biaknak hrangah a dangte in ret an si ding. Cuih beel cu thawinak a petu pawl in an pekmi thawinak sa suannak ah an hmang ding. Cuih ni a thlen tikah Ziangkimtithei Bawipa ih Biakinn sungah thil zuartu le thil leitu pakhat hman an um nawn lo ding a si.
  </para>
</usx>
